WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.803
Welcome to Anglia Educate! Here’s your quick tour.

00:00:05.553 --> 00:00:09.305
This is your dashboard. Start here every time you study…

00:00:09.305 --> 00:00:12.586
your next live lesson is always at the top.

00:00:12.887 --> 00:00:15.537
Every other page lives down the side.

00:00:16.487 --> 00:00:20.116
Now, your plan for the week comes in three parts.

00:00:20.416 --> 00:00:23.766
New learning is this week’s brand-new topic.

00:00:24.216 --> 00:00:28.943
Missed work returning is anything from an earlier week you didn’t get to.

00:00:29.244 --> 00:00:34.459
And Revision brings back points you’ve already practised, just before you’d forget them.

00:00:34.758 --> 00:00:39.466
Your weekly task list has a video, a quiz and a task for every point.

00:00:39.466 --> 00:00:42.255
Tick each one off when you’re done.

00:00:42.805 --> 00:00:46.966
Quizzes mark themselves instantly, and explain every answer.

00:00:46.966 --> 00:00:50.973
You get one go per quiz each week, so make it count!

00:00:51.523 --> 00:00:55.566
Tasks are answered right on the page, and save as you type…

00:00:55.566 --> 00:00:57.210
but submitting is final.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:01.516
They come back with marks and feedback on every question.

00:01:01.966 --> 00:01:06.709
Do a few, and you’ll see your predicted grade on Tasks and Grades.

00:01:07.159 --> 00:01:11.318
Stuck? Message your tutor, and attach the task or quiz.

00:01:11.318 --> 00:01:14.970
And press Command K to find anything, fast.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.503
That’s it, you’re all set. Let’s go!

